/Subject (Protecting drinking, recreational, and other water from toxic cyanobacteria has a major impact on health. This new edition outlines water-related exposure pathways, supports hazard analysis and risk assessment, and outlines strategies for their control and the design and implementation of monitoring programmes.)
/Title (Toxic Cyanobacteria in Water; A Guide to Their Public Health Consequences, Monitoring and Management; Second Edition)
/Trapped /False
